---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Nav from '../../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Toile Blanche Breakfast | Suites & Restaurant | Toile Blanche"
  description=""
  ogImage="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/639af6c370637a9be3e3b0b0/63dbc14a7fa59e1233dd4d93_Neutral%20Beige%20Minimalist%20Photo%20Collage%20Facebook%20Cover%20(1).jpg"
>
  <Nav theme="both" />

  <div class="section bottom-padding-192 no-top-padding"><div class="container"><div class="hero4" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1.01, 1.01, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1.01, 1.01, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1.01, 1.01, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1.01, 1.01, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);opacity:0"><div class="subtitle">Breakfast</div><h1>coffee, croissants &amp; cereals  </h1><div class="hero-paragraph"><p class="paragraph-12">One not to be missed is the breakfast. Whether you're an early bird wishing to start your day as soon as possible, or a late riser, you can choose any kind of breakfast you desire. <br/><br/>MENU / HOURS: 8:00am - 10h30am</p></div><div class="hero-arrow"><img alt="arrow down" class="hero-arrow-image" loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/page-img-1e6e73d27d5690.svg" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 24PX, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 24PX, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 24PX, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 24PX, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0)"/></div></div></div></div><div><div class="full-frame-image-wrapper breakfast"><div class="full-frame-image-content"><p class="light">Breathtaking views and delicious food</p></div></div></div><div class="section"><div class="container"><div class="left-padding"><h2>No need to rush for breakfast</h2></div></div></div><div class="section no-top-padding"><div class="container"><div class="centered-paragraph"><p class="feature-paragraph medium-width">“I don't really like coffee" she said, "but I don't really like it when my head hits the table when I fall asleep either".</p></div><div class="divider _96px"></div><div class="grid-layout"><div class="grid-layout-section-content"><div class="grid-layout-content-wrapper"><div class="card-image-wapper-fixed small-height"><img alt="" class="card-image-fixed" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 90vw, (max-width: 1439px) 45vw, 40vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-90d67bc14d6e33.webp"/></div><div class="card-content-wrapper"></div></div><div class="divider _144px"></div><div class="grid-layout-content-wrapper left-padding"><div class="card-image-wapper medium-height"><img alt="" class="card-image" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 90vw, (max-width: 767px) 45vw, (max-width: 1439px) 40vw, 35vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-0cb6a2524fa474.jpg"/></div><div class="card-content-wrapper"></div></div></div><div class="grid-layout-section-content"><div class="divider _288px mobile-none"></div><div class="grid-layout-content-wrapper left-padding right-padding" data-w-id="233c745a-a3bb-2a95-f5ec-4b6fab58679e"><div class="card-image-wapper-fixed medium-height"><img alt="" class="card-image-fixed" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 90vw, (max-width: 767px) 45vw, (max-width: 1439px) 35vw, 30vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-21bedcbb150956.avif"/></div><div class="card-content-wrapper"></div></div></div></div></div></div>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
